# FVE design configuration and yield estimate (#77). Requires a JWT with role Admin/Designer (write)
# or Admin/Sales/Designer (read). The design must be InDesign (parameters set via PUT /parameters).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@designId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@panelId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@inverterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Check compatibility and estimate yield without saving
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/configuration/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panelId": "{{panelId}}",
  "panelCount": 12,
  "inverterId": "{{inverterId}}"
}

### Save the configuration as a new immutable version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panelId": "{{panelId}}",
  "panelCount": 12,
  "inverterId": "{{inverterId}}"
}

### List versions (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get version 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/versions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve the design (Admin/Sales); the newest saved version becomes the approved one
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send the design back to the designer (Admin/Sales); withdraws an approval and marks linked quotes for recalculation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/rework
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Zákazník chce väčší výkon"
}

### Create a Draft quote from the approved design (Admin/Sales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/designs/{{designId}}/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
